OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage chiefs 'down but not out'
OL,4,Aafter bid blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeritage chiefs say they are "down but
OL,7,Fnot out" after a #4.9m funding bid to
OL,8,Ffurther develop parts of a nine-mile
OL,9,F(14km) nature trail was rejected.
OL,11,FThe Tyne Derwent Way connects a number
OL,12,Fof historical sites between St Mary's
OL,13,FHeritage Centre in the centre of
OL,14,FGateshead and the National Trust's
OL,15,FGibside estate in the Derwent Valley.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
