OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage chiefs 'down but not out'
OL,4,Aafter bid blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application had been submitted to
OL,7,Fthe National Lottery Heritage Fund to
OL,8,Fhelp cover the costs of repairing the
OL,9,Ffire-hit Dunston Staiths - a Grade II
OL,10,Flisted wooden structure once used to
OL,11,Fload coal on to ships on the River
OL,12,FTyne.
OL,14,FClare Richardson, programme lead for
OL,15,Fthe Tyne Derwent Way, said a "revised,
OL,16,Fscaled-down" proposal was likely to be
OL,17,Fput forward early next year.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
